# Speculo session logs are local process evidence, not repository artifacts
.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/**/sessions/**/logs/

# SpecDev evidence: only verification result reports (Markdown stating pass/fail and why) are tracked.
# Everything else under evidence/ (review inputs, patches, logs, screenshots, build output, code,
# hash manifests, budget attributions, run audits) stays local. See AGENTS.md "SpecDev evidence 入库规则".
/.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/**/evidence/**
!/.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/**/evidence/**/
!/.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/*/evidence/T-[0-9][0-9].md
!/.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/*/evidence/T-[0-9][0-9][0-9].md
!/.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/*/evidence/report*.md
!/.agents/speculo/.speculo/specdev/changes/*/prototypes/*/evidence/approval-*.md
